<title>USA: BetzDearborn Q4 shr $0.35 vs $0.28.</title>
<headline>BetzDearborn Q4 shr $0.35 vs $0.28.</headline>
<dateline>TREVOSE, Pa. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>BETZDEARBORN INC.</p>
<p>		    (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			    Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>				     December 31,     December 31,</p>
<p>			     1996	  1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net sales	    $323,182   $189,833 $1,036,969   $752,453</p>
