<p>   Primary		28,571     27,808     28,105     27,889</p>
<p>   Fully diluted	31,363     30,570     30,927     30,651</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding integration and restructuring costs, net earnings for the quarter would have been $21.8 million, compared with $17.8 million for the same period last year, an increase of 22 percent.  Fully diluted earnings per share, excluding integration and restructuring costs in both years, would have been $0.68 compared with $0.56 in 1995, an increase of 21 percent.</p>
<p>Total integration and restructuring costs for the quarter amounted to $15.5 million, compared with $14.3 million for the same period in 1995.  Also, in the second quarter of 1996 the company changed its vesting policy for certain employee benefits which increased net earnings by about $1.6 million during the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>BetzDearborn Inc.</p>
